        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-013044",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, because of the extensive time required for clinical development and regulatory review of any current or future product candidates we may develop, it is possible that, before any current or future product candidates can be commercialized, any related patent may expire or remain in force for only a short period following commercialization, thereby limiting the protection such patent would afford the respective product and any competitive advantage such patent may provide.",
